1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:09,738
Finding opportunities should not be complicated. Yet information is
scattered across institutions, portals, and eligibility rules.

2
00:00:10,138 --> 00:00:16,156
People need to know where to look, what a listing requires, and which
step to take next.

3
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:27,283
UMBRAL is an international opportunity companion, built to turn that
uncertainty into a clearer path.

4
00:00:27,683 --> 00:00:36,601
Choose a country independently of your language. The initial catalogue
covers five countries, alongside international options.

5
00:00:37,001 --> 00:00:43,299
The Illuminated Threshold uses warm light and gateways to make the
interface feel calm and recognizable.

6
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:54,018
Choose Employment, then open a specific vacancy. Each card highlights its
location, benefit, and a key requirement.

7
00:00:54,418 --> 00:01:03,596
This example asks for completed secondary education and basic computer
skills. Read the full requirements and conditions before applying.

8
00:01:03,996 --> 00:01:13,278
Unknown details stay unknown. Review dates and availability are
editorial, and the official source remains the place to confirm and
apply.

9
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:24,193
Save an opportunity in My Route without submitting an application. Your
preparation stays in this browser, without an account.

10
00:01:24,593 --> 00:01:31,041
Mark a preparation step and add a simple task. Reloading keeps this local
progress.

11
00:01:31,441 --> 00:01:39,030
You can download or print your plan. These marks describe preparation,
never approval or eligibility.

12
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:48,428
On mobile, Save is easy to reach beside the summary. The conditions and
complete requirements remain available.

13
00:01:48,828 --> 00:01:59,130
In Peru, a direct CSE entrance leads to the five-step guide and
checklist. UMBRAL neither classifies households nor submits the official
request.

14
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:06,659
Kiro built the initial React and TypeScript MVP through original
specifications and steering documents.

15
00:02:07,059 --> 00:02:13,587
These are the actual requirements, design, tasks, and five steering
files, preserved in the repository.

16
00:02:13,987 --> 00:02:24,300
Codex later audited, corrected, tested, and evolved the international
catalogue and visual experience. The application does not call an AI
model at runtime.

17
00:02:25,700 --> 00:02:32,559
This is a working product, with automated checks and honest limits. Human
usability sessions are still pending.

18
00:02:32,959 --> 00:02:39,300
UMBRAL. Real opportunities. Clearer paths. A brighter next step.
